sequenceDiagram
    participant Crawler as Product Crawler
    participant Ingest as Time-Series Ingest
    participant TSDB as Price Event Log (TSDB)
    participant Cache as Current Offer Cache
    participant Evaluator as Threshold Alert Evaluator
    participant Notifier as Notification Dispatcher

    Crawler->>Ingest: Submit crawl observation (price, SKU)
    Ingest->>Ingest: Validate and Deduplicate
    Ingest->>TSDB: Append new price event
    TSDB-->>Ingest: Acknowledge append
    Ingest->>Cache: Update current price
    Ingest->>Evaluator: Publish OfferChanged event

    Evaluator->>Evaluator: Scan active alert rules for product
    alt Alert condition met (e.g. Price Drop)
        Evaluator->>Notifier: Emit deduped alert delivery job
        Notifier->>Notifier: Deliver to user channels (Email, Push)
    end
